<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Pacific Chemical 6-mth net down.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Pacific Chemical 6-mth net down.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     16.97	   vs	  18.52</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)    15.4	    vs	   16.8</p>
<p>    Turnover		 70.37	   vs	  69.97</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 23.42	   vs	  25.87</p>
<p>NOTE: Company's full name is Pacific Chemicals Bhd. It is involved in the trading and logs and production of sawn timber.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
